@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title COLORS — Use Case Diagram
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  BorderColor #334155
}
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #334155

actor User

rectangle "COLORS web application" {
  usecase "Log in" as Login
  usecase "Add a color name" as Add
  usecase "Search saved colors" as Search
  usecase "Log out" as Logout
}

User -- Login
User -- Add
User -- Search
User -- Logout

note right of Login
  Existing account required.
  Invalid credentials display an error.
end note

note right of Add
  Add, search, and logout are on color.html.
  The page reads the login cookie on load.
  This is a browser UI precondition;
  the APIs do not verify a server session.
end note

note right of Search
  Searches color names for the supplied user ID.
  Empty search returns all that user's colors.
end note

note right of Logout
  Clears browser state and expires the cookie.
  Returns to index.html; no logout API call.
end note
@enduml
